And it came to pass, when all the kings which
In respect to the plain of Moab. [were] on this side Jordan, in the hills, and in the valleys, and in all the coasts of the
The main sea called the Mediterranean. great sea over against Lebanon, the Hittite, and the Amorite, the Canaanite, the Perizzite, the Hivite, and the Jebusite, heard [thereof];

They did work wilily, and went and made as if they had been ambassadors, and took old sacks upon their asses, and wine bottles, old, and rent, and 

